    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="29efcd2c-2658-5641-87c8-1d682e28839b" activityNameId="4c7ffe41-7382-5193-95d8-052f36ceee03" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Sorting plant for construction waste</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Sorting plant for construction waste
Sorting plant with a construction waste throughput of 200'000 tons per year. Operation time 50 years.;
UUID: e27f1d74-b73f-37da-905e-277aed8d8c25
infrastructure materials including replacement parts during operation, transport and disposal of infastructure. Land use. Fuel oil demand from small administrative building. Operation time 50 years.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Construction waste sorting plants usually feature a jaw or impact crusher. Here materials from a cone crusher are inventoried. Infrastructure materials are adapted from LCI for a rock crusher for gravel production. Reduced wear and tear from lower annual throughput in construction waste sorting plant (200kt/a) is heeded. 
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature data 
Extrapolations: See Technology/Text
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_e27f1d74-b73f-37da-905e-277aed8d8c25.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="fdab769f-4bdb-5024-8349-c1745bbb2597" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
        <shortname xml:lang="en">CH</shortname>
        <comment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Location: &lt;null&gt;</text>
        </comment>
      </geography>
      <technology>
        <comment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Technology: Construction waste sorting plants usually feature a jaw or impact crusher. Here materials from a cone crusher are inventoried. Infrastructure materials are adapted from LCI for a rock crusher for gravel production. Reduced wear and tear from lower annual throughput in construction waste sorting plant (200kt/a) is heeded. </text>
        </comment>
      </technology>
      <timePeriod startDate="2000-01-01" endDate="2000-12-31" isDataValidForEntirePeriod="true">
        <comment>
